WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.240
- Now I know you promised Nance
that you would keep us safe.

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.889
So keep us safe.

00:00:05.889 --> 00:00:07.294
(booms)

00:00:07.294 --> 00:00:08.596
(sighs)

00:00:08.596 --> 00:00:09.429
(bangs)

00:00:09.429 --> 00:00:11.470
- Hey, dickheads.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.300
How come the only one helping
me out is this random girl?

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.570
We lose light in 40 minutes, let's go.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:16.403
Let's go I said.

00:00:16.403 --> 00:00:17.800
- [Dustin] All right, asshole!

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.830
God.
- Stupid.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:19.980
- If a coach calls a play in the game

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.900
bottom line you execute it, all right?

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.080
- Okay first of all this
isn't some stupid sports game

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.130
and second, we're not even in the game

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.087
we're on the bench.

00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:29.333
- Right, so my point is ...

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:32.880
Right, yeah, we're on the bench

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.770
so there's nothing we can do.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.090
- Maybe if we set this on fire.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.050
- No yeah, that's a no.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.450
- The Mind Flayer would
call away his army.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:39.500
- They'd all come to stop us.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.333
- Hey.
- Then we circle

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:41.166
back to the exit.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:41.999
- Guys.
- By the time they realize

00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:42.832
we're gone--
- El would

00:00:42.832 --> 00:00:43.665
be at the gate.
- Hey.

00:00:43.665 --> 00:00:46.200
Hey, hey, hey.
(clapping)

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.033
It's not happening.

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:47.866
- But--
- No, no, no, no, no,

00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:49.840
no buts, I promised I'd
keep you shitheads safe

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.460
and that's exactly what I plan on doing.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.426
We're staying here on the bench

00:00:53.426 --> 00:00:55.100
and we're waiting for the starting team

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.090
to do their job, does
everybody understand that?

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.320
- This isn't a stupid sports game!

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.320
- I said does everybody understand that?

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.320
Whoa, whoa, whoa, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey,

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:04.213
I don't think so.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:06.850
Any of you little shits die down here

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.060
I'm getting the blame.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.620
Got it, dipshit?

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:10.640
- Didn't you hear our code red?

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.580
- Yeah, and I couldn't understand

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.560
half of what you were saying.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.720
- God damn low battery!

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:14.820
- How many times do I have to tell you

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:15.860
with the low battery!?

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.056
- [Dustin] You have to admit

00:01:17.056 --> 00:01:19.770
as just as a feat of engineering
alone this is impressive.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:20.800
- What are you talking about?

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:22.580
It's a total fire hazard,
there's no stairs,

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.100
there's no exit, there's just an elevator

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.680
that drops you half way to hell.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:30.107
I may be a pretty shitty boyfriend but ...

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.840
Turns out I'm actually a
pretty damn good babysitter.

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.980
- You're an idiot Steve Harrington.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:40.173
No, Steve!
(booms)

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.101
- What is, what the?

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:42.966
- You need to get outta here.

00:01:42.966 --> 00:01:43.799
- What is all this?

00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:44.632
- Listen to me, I'm not asking you,

00:01:44.632 --> 00:01:45.465
I'm telling you--
- What is that smell--

00:01:45.465 --> 00:01:46.375
- Get out of here!
- Is that gasoline!?

00:01:46.375 --> 00:01:47.628
(gun clicks)
- Steve, get out.

00:01:47.628 --> 00:01:49.470
- Wait, wait, what!?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:51.002
- It's here.
- Wait what?

00:01:51.002 --> 00:01:51.835
- [Jonathan] Here.

00:01:51.835 --> 00:01:52.668
- Where is it?

00:01:52.668 --> 00:01:53.501
- Where is what, whoa!

00:01:53.501 --> 00:01:54.334
Easy with that!
- Where is it?

00:01:54.334 --> 00:01:55.640
- I don't know, I don't see it.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.001
- Where's what!?

00:01:57.001 --> 00:01:58.687
Whoa, will someone explain to me

00:01:58.687 --> 00:02:00.153
what the hell is going--
(crashes)

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.326
Oh my god, oh my god, oh my god, oh!

00:02:02.326 --> 00:02:03.730
(sinister music)

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:04.600
(door slams)

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.690
Jesus, Jesus, what the hell was that?

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:07.523
What the hell was that!?

00:02:07.523 --> 00:02:08.480
- [Both] Shut up!

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.313
- [Steve] What is that?

00:02:09.313 --> 00:02:10.146
- [Group] Morse code.

00:02:10.146 --> 00:02:11.940
- [Hopper] H-E-R-E.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:12.773
- His army.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:14.850
- What do you mean?

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:16.310
Whoa, slow down, slow down.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.020
- It believes it's the master race.

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.800
- Like the, like the Germans.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.863
- The Nazis?

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:23.700
- Yeah yeah, yeah the Nazis.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:24.926
- Russian?

00:02:24.926 --> 00:02:26.554
(speaking in Pig Latin)

00:02:26.554 --> 00:02:27.614
- Ho-ho-ho-ho!

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:28.447
- Holy shit!

00:02:28.447 --> 00:02:30.760
- That was Pig Latin, dingus.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:31.593
- Idiot.

00:02:31.593 --> 00:02:32.800
You think the Russians know about?

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.010
- They could.

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:34.990
- So it's connected?

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:36.030
- Maybe.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:36.863
- How?

00:02:36.863 --> 00:02:39.620
- I don't know, but it's possible.

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:40.680
- [Robin] I'm sorry is
there something you two

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.423
would like to share with the class?

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.851
(winds growling)

00:02:47.851 --> 00:02:48.768
- The gate.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:51.590
- I'm sorry, who are you?

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:52.890
- I'm Robin, I work with Steve.

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:54.290
- She cracked the top secret code.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.210
- Yeah which is how we found out

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.270
about the Russians in the first place.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:57.770
- Russians, but what Russians?

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:58.603
- The Russians!

00:02:58.603 --> 00:02:59.510
- What happened to that car?

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:00.600
- El has super powers.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:01.433
- [Robin] I'm sorry?

00:03:01.433 --> 00:03:02.540
- Super powers, she
threw it with her mind.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.373
Come on, catch up.

00:03:03.373 --> 00:03:05.430
So I'll be over around, say like eight?

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:06.697
- Are you crazy?

00:03:06.697 --> 00:03:07.848
My mom would not allow

00:03:07.848 --> 00:03:08.681
