even know I'm there.

00:03:09.514 --> 00:03:10.691
I'm stealthy, like a ninja.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:12.691
(booms)

00:03:15.696 --> 00:03:16.914
(crashes)

00:03:16.914 --> 00:03:20.225
(thumps)
(grunts)

00:03:20.225 --> 00:03:21.058
Holy shit.

00:03:23.911 --> 00:03:25.096
(growling)

00:03:25.096 --> 00:03:26.779
(scraping)

00:03:26.779 --> 00:03:27.612
(whacks)
(monster screams)

00:03:27.612 --> 00:03:28.890
You gotta be slow.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:32.854
Gotta be stealthy, like a ninja.

00:03:32.854 --> 00:03:37.854
(suspenseful music)
(ticking)

00:03:38.813 --> 00:03:42.480
(intense suspenseful music)

00:03:44.889 --> 00:03:47.556
