00:03:48.751 --> 00:03:50.751
(bangs)

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.920
What'd I tell you?

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:54.753
Ninja.

00:03:56.678 --> 00:03:58.910
- Did you not hear the
part about the massive gun?

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:00.420
- Yes, Dustin, I did.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.483
And that's why I would be sneaking.

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:06.200
