00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.789
- Their family is a
disgrace to the entire--

00:04:10.789 --> 00:04:14.558
(grunts)
(punches)

00:04:14.558 --> 00:04:15.391
(grunts)

00:04:15.391 --> 00:04:17.650
(mumbling)
- Or what?

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.570
Or what?

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:20.387
You gonna fight me now too, huh!?

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.814
- No one tells me what to do.

00:04:23.814 --> 00:04:25.063
(smacking)
(grunts)

00:04:25.063 --> 00:04:26.396
(yelling)
(cheering)

00:04:26.396 --> 00:04:28.629
(screaming)

00:04:28.629 --> 00:04:30.018
(smacks)

00:04:30.018 --> 00:04:33.100
(swishing)
(grunting)

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:34.921
(grunting)

00:04:34.921 --> 00:04:36.901
(thuds)

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.414
(smacks)

00:04:38.414 --> 00:04:39.436
(intense swelling music)

00:04:39.436 --> 00:04:40.900
(whacks)
(grunts)

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.261
(smashes)
(thuds)

00:04:42.261 --> 00:04:44.890
